  << /ActualText (Software Application Developer \0509 months\051\nSRK\055Consulting\nMay 2025 \055 Present\054 Buenos Aires \055 Remote\nDesign and automate robust\054 scalable cloud\055native and on\055premises infrastructures\054 bridging the gap between technical architecture and secure\054 high\055performance systems\056\nStandardize operational workflows by developing custom scripts to transform complex deployment into automated processes\056\nCollaborate on product strategy to solve user journeys\054 aligning technical constraints with client requirements and producing clear traceable documentation for complex data models\056\n\nTechnical Product Owner \053 Channel Analyst   \0501y 10 months\051 \nFlexways \050Promoted\051\nApr 2024 \055 Apr 2025\054 Buenos Aires \055 Hybrid\nCollaborated on digital transformation and AI integration\054 defining product short\055term roadmaps and managing backlogs\056\nBridged the gap between stakeholders and development teams\054 translating complex requirements into detailed user stories and clear acceptance criteria\056\nAnalyzed product performance through KPIs and user feedback to drive continuous improvement and implement AI\055driven operational enhancements\056\nJul 2023 \055 Apr 2024\054 Buenos Aires \055 Hybrid\nDesigned dynamic dashboards and analyzed sales performance to identify trends and patterns\054 providing the data\055driven visibility needed for strategic decision\055making\056\nDefined operational workflows and API behaviors\054 acting as a technical translator to align complex business requirements with IT\054\nOptimized daily operations through custom scripts and automations\056\n\nIT Recruiter \053 Operations Analyst  \0502y 11 months\051 \nDevborn \055 Jul 2020 \055 May 2023\054 Buenos Aires \055 Remote\nAutomated recruitment workflows via Google Apps Script\054 integrating Zapier\054 HubSpot\054 and Google Workspace\056\n)
